msgstr "Tilføj fra Facebook"

#: includes/class-facebook-importer.php:70
msgid "Paste one or more public Facebook event URLs, one per line (e.g. https://www.facebook.com/events/1234567890). Each new URL becomes a draft event prefilled with whatever Facebook exposes (title, date, organiser, cover image); you complete the routes and address in the editor and publish. URLs that were imported before are skipped, so it is safe to re-paste a whole list."
msgstr "Indsæt et eller flere links til offentlige Facebook-begivenheder, ét pr. linje (f.eks. https://www.facebook.com/events/1234567890). Hvert nyt link bliver til en kladde, udfyldt med det Facebook viser (titel, dato, arrangør, forsidebillede); du udfylder ruter og adresse i editoren og udgiver. Links, der er importeret før, springes over, så det er sikkert at indsætte en hel liste igen."

#: includes/class-facebook-importer.php:76
msgid "Facebook event URLs, one per line"
msgstr "Links til Facebook-begivenheder, ét pr. linje"

#. translators: %d: maximum number of URLs per import.
#: includes/class-facebook-importer.php:80
#, php-format
msgid "Up to %d links per import. Each event is fetched from Facebook, so a large batch takes a little while."
msgstr "Op til %d links pr. import. Hver begivenhed hentes fra Facebook, så mange links på én gang tager lidt tid."

#: includes/class-facebook-importer.php:82
msgid "Create draft events"
msgstr "Opret kladder"

#: includes/class-facebook-importer.php:104
msgid "You are not allowed to import events."
msgstr "Du har ikke tilladelse til at importere begivenheder."

#: includes/class-facebook-importer.php:418
msgid "Facebook event (untitled import)"
msgstr "Facebook-begivenhed (importeret uden titel)"

